===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*sed-}}
From {{der|en|la|dissidēns}}, {{m|la|dissidentis}}, present participle of {{m|la|dissidēre||to [[sit]] [[apart]]; to [[disagree]]}}, from {{m|la|dis-||[[asunder]], [[apart]], in [[two]]}} + {{m|la|sedēre||to sit}}.

